# ============================================================================
# goat-client .gitignore
# Tuned for Go + Fyne desktop GUI + gomobile (iOS / Android) builds.
# ============================================================================

# ---- Go build artifacts ---------------------------------------------------
# Compiled binaries — leave the cmd/ source tree intact, ignore built output.
/goat-clientd
/goat-client
/cmd/goat-clientd/goat-clientd
/cmd/goat-client/goat-client
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Go test + coverage artifacts.
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt
coverage.html
profile.cov

# Go workspace + tooling state.
go.work
go.work.sum
vendor/
bin/
dist/

# ---- Fyne desktop GUI builds ---------------------------------------------
# `fyne package` outputs.
*.app/
*.appimage
*.AppImage
fyne-cross/

# Auto-generated bundled assets if `fyne bundle` is used directly.
bundled.go

# ---- gomobile (iOS + Android) outputs ------------------------------------
# `gomobile bind -target=ios` produces an .xcframework directory.
*.xcframework/
mobile/ios/**/*.xcframework/

# `gomobile bind -target=android` produces .aar (+ matching -sources.jar).
*.aar
*-sources.jar
mobile/android/**/*.aar

# Xcode user state inside the iOS shell project.
mobile/ios/Shell/**/xcuserdata/
mobile/ios/Shell/**/*.xcuserstate
mobile/ios/Shell/**/DerivedData/
mobile/ios/Shell/**/Pods/

# Android Studio / Gradle state inside the Android shell project.
mobile/android/Shell/.gradle/
mobile/android/Shell/build/
mobile/android/Shell/**/build/
mobile/android/Shell/local.properties
mobile/android/Shell/.idea/
mobile/android/Shell/captures/
mobile/android/Shell/.cxx/

# ---- Per-platform packaging build outputs ---------------------------------
# Track F outputs — keep manifests under packaging/<fmt>/ but ignore builds.
packaging/deb/build/
packaging/rpm/build/
packaging/rpm/RPMS/
packaging/rpm/SRPMS/
packaging/dmg/build/
packaging/dmg/*.dmg
packaging/msi/build/
packaging/msi/*.msi
packaging/**/*.deb
packaging/**/*.rpm

# ---- Release-pipeline staging --------------------------------------------
# Track E's release.yml stages signed binaries here in CI; locals shouldn't
# be checking these in.
release/
*.sha256
SHA256SUMS
*.cert
*.sig
*.bundle.json
# (Leave the CBOR bundle test fixtures alone — those go under testdata/.)

# ---- iso-mode + Claude Code worktree state -------------------------------
# Per HANDOFF.md, parallel-track work uses .claude/worktrees/<track>/ off
# main; the per-track env file may carry session-scoped paths.
.iso-mode.env
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/local/
.claude/settings.local.json
# Operator-specific Claude Code session config (per-checkout permission
# allowlists etc.). Stays local.
.claude/settings.json

# ---- Mobile-pipeline local artifacts --------------------------------------
# Playwright MCP session artifacts (page snapshots, console logs) — generated
# locally by browser-automation MCP tools.
.playwright-mcp/

# iOS archive + ipa output. The archive-and-upload.sh script writes here.
# Build artifacts are uploaded to TestFlight directly; nothing here should
# be committed.
/build/

# ---- IDE state -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
.history/

# ---- OS noise ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Secrets + local config ----------------------------------------------
# Belt-and-suspenders. Never commit private keys, env files, or secret
# stashes. (Bundle test fixtures should be CBOR + .test.cbor named so they
# don't accidentally match these patterns.)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# direnv: operator-laptop-specific env exports (e.g. GOAT_LAB_* for the
# realprotocol smoke run locally against a still-allowlisted prod peer
# after the GH secrets are deleted post-#15 sunset). Author-side .envrc
# may exist; .envrc.local is always operator-private.
.envrc
.envrc.local
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.age
secrets/
